  "description": "SLIDE fast as you can!\nRace through snowy slopes in Sled Surfers, the ultimate winter SLEDDING GAME!\n\nDODGE trees, leap over ice, and grab power-ups as you speed downhill.\nSlide through snow into mountains, forests, cities, subways, caves, and beyond.\nHow far can you go?\n\nInspired by ENDLESS RUNNER hits, Sled Surfers delivers FAST action, SMOOTH controls, and endless FUN.\n\nFeatures:\n• High-speed sledding on icy tracks\n• Endless runs and exciting level-based challenges\n• Tons of surfers characters and sleds to unlock\n• Explore mountains, caves, and frozen forests\n\nSimple to play, hard to master.\nDownload now and ride the snow!\n\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
  "release_notes": "Less bugs, more speed!\nWe’ve made behind-the-scenes improvements to keep Sled Surfers running smoothly.\nExpect better performance, fewer crashes, and a more responsive sled experience.\nUpdate now and glide through the snow with confidence!",
